<title>JAPAN: Queensland Treasury launches yen/A$ dual samurais.</title>
<headline>Queensland Treasury launches yen/A$ dual samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Queensland Treasury Corp on Thursday launched 25 billion yen worth of yen/Australian dollar dual currency samurai bonds with a 5.5 percent coupon, a spokesman at lead-manager Daiwa Securities said.</p>
<p>The bonds will mature on November 25, 1999.</p>
</text>
